<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>D&eacute;part &middot; In&eacute;galit&eacute; triangulaire &middot; 5e S6J4</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --day-color:#3ab5d8;--day-dark:#1a6e88;--day-light:#e8f6fb;--day-border:#9dd4e8;
  --day-glow:rgba(58,181,216,.3);--bg:#fffdf7;--surface:#ffffff;--border:#e8e3d4;
  --yellow:#f5c518;--green:#8dc63f;--blue:#3ab5d8;--pink:#f28b82;
  --text:#1c1a14;--muted:#8a8576;--radius:18px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:var(--bg);
  background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 85% 12%,rgba(245,197,24,.10),transparent 42%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 12% 88%,rgba(58,181,216,.08),transparent 42%);
  background-attachment:fixed;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;min-height:100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;position:relative;padding:28px 16px 60px;}
body::before{content:'';position:fixed;width:340px;height:340px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--yellow);top:-80px;right:-80px;opacity:.13;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
body::after{content:'';position:fixed;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--day-color);bottom:-60px;left:-60px;opacity:.13;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
.bubble-green{position:fixed;width:180px;height:180px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--green);bottom:120px;right:-40px;opacity:.10;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
.bubble-blue{position:fixed;width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--blue);top:200px;left:-30px;opacity:.10;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;}
.wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto}
.logo-badge-wrap{text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.logo-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--yellow);
  border-radius:999px;padding:9px 22px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:1px;
  text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
.dots{display:flex;gap:6px}
.dots span{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%}
.dots .d1{background:var(--green)}.dots .d2{background:var(--blue)}
.weekday{text-align:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;}
h1{text-align:center;font-size:34px;color:var(--day-dark);margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:.5px;}
.subtitle{text-align:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;
  color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:30px;}
.visual{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:30px}
.visual figure{max-width:520px;width:100%;margin:0;background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:8px;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.10);overflow:hidden;}
.visual figcaption{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;
  color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:8px 4px 2px;}
.context-box{background:var(--day-light);border:2px solid var(--day-border);
  border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px 24px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:17px;}
.theme-badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--day-color);color:var(--text);
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:1px;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;
  margin-bottom:14px;text-transform:uppercase;}
.context-box p{margin-bottom:8px}
.materiel{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--day-border);border-radius:12px;
  padding:12px 16px;margin:12px 0;}
.materiel .mat-label{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;
  color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:700;}
.mat-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 0;font-size:15px;}
.mat-item::before{content:"\25B8";color:var(--day-color);font-weight:bold;}
.question-highlight{background:var(--day-light);border:2px solid var(--day-color);
  border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:18px;
  font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;}
.question-highlight .hl{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.mission-box{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px 24px;margin-bottom:8px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.04);}
.mission-box .mtitle{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a8f9a;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;}
.mission-box .mline{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:16px}
.mission-box .mline:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.mission-box .mline .arrow{color:var(--day-dark);font-weight:bold;flex-shrink:0}
.mission-box .mline strong{color:var(--day-dark)}
@media(max-width:540px){h1{font-size:28px}body{padding:20px 12px 50px}.question-highlight{font-size:17px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bubble-green"></div>
<div class="bubble-blue"></div>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="logo-badge-wrap">
    <div class="logo-badge">
      <span class="dots"><span class="d1"></span><span class="d2"></span></span>
      Pazapa &middot; Maths &middot; 5&egrave;me
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="weekday">Semaine 6 &mdash; Jour 4</div>
  <h1>D&eacute;fi du jour</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Mission Himalaya &mdash; Utiliser l&rsquo;in&eacute;galit&eacute; triangulaire</p>

  <div class="visual">
    <figure>
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Carte topographique avec trois camps de base formant un triangle, carnet de relevés prêt, aucune vérification encore effectuée" style="width:100%;display:block;border-radius:12px;">
      <figcaption>Carte topographique &mdash; trois camps de base, carnet de relev&eacute;s pr&ecirc;t, aucun trac&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="context-box">
    <div class="theme-badge">&#x26FA;&#xFE0F; Exp&eacute;dition en montagne &mdash; Jour 4</div>
    <p>L&rsquo;&eacute;quipe pr&eacute;pare une nouvelle liaison entre trois refuges install&eacute;s dans la montagne. Les <strong>distances entre chaque refuge</strong> sont connues gr&acirc;ce aux relev&eacute;s effectu&eacute;s la veille.</p>
    <p>Avant de fabriquer les c&acirc;bles de liaison, le chef d&rsquo;exp&eacute;dition souhaite v&eacute;rifier si ces trois distances permettent r&eacute;ellement de <strong>construire le triangle pr&eacute;vu sur la carte</strong>.</p>
    <p>Tout le mat&eacute;riel est pr&ecirc;t, mais aucune v&eacute;rification n&rsquo;a encore &eacute;t&eacute; r&eacute;alis&eacute;e.</p>
    <div class="materiel">
      <div class="mat-label">Mat&eacute;riel disponible</div>
      <div class="mat-item">une carte topographique</div>
      <div class="mat-item">trois longueurs indiqu&eacute;es sur un carnet de relev&eacute;s</div>
      <div class="mat-item">une r&egrave;gle gradu&eacute;e</div>
      <div class="mat-item">un compas</div>
      <div class="mat-item">un crayon de g&eacute;om&egrave;tre</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-highlight">
    Comment savoir si <span class="hl">trois longueurs</span> permettent de construire un triangle&nbsp;?
  </div>

  <div class="mission-box">
    <div class="mtitle">Ta mission</div>
    <div class="mline"><span class="arrow">&rarr;</span><span><strong>Suis le parcours du jour</strong> pour d&eacute;couvrir la condition &agrave; v&eacute;rifier.</span></div>
    <div class="mline"><span class="arrow">&rarr;</span><span>&Agrave; la fin du parcours, tu pourras <strong>d&eacute;terminer si les trois distances permettent de construire le triangle</strong>.</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
